id: pm-beads-sdk-floor-1025
title: Align host and npm floors with published SDK capabilities
description: "Audit runtime SDK usage on main against published artifacts, record first-version evidence, and enforce the required compatibility floor without changing the development SDK pin."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[2]: audit-1025,sdk-floor
created_at: "2026-10-26T05:58:23.015Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-26T06:19:01.531Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Source API inventory and published adjacent-release evidence recorded; both supported-host declarations cover every used API; targeted checks pass; review evidence remains separate from release authority.
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-26T05:58:45.049Z",codex-agent,"Auditing the current main runtime imports, client calls, and host context members. First-release evidence will come from published npm tarballs packed with lifecycle scripts disabled, inspected as data only. Existing tracker histories remain append-only."
  "2026-10-26T06:16:27.143Z",codex-agent,"floor verified: 46 source-derived API contracts require pm 2026.9.8; main declares host 2026.10.15 and npm >=2026.10.15. Audited main f345866a0e9b523b1cfc65968d8d113bd81007c0. Binary search inspected 98 published stable tarballs, their static ESM exports and dist declarations, with adjacent negative/positive boundaries and SHA-256 receipts. Full API-to-first-version table and per-source uses are committed in docs/sdk-floor.md and docs/sdk-floor.json. No downloaded pm code was executed; this is API-availability evidence, not older-host behavioral acceptance."
  "2026-10-26T06:16:37.298Z",codex-agent,"Targeted validation passed: npm run typecheck, including the unchanged pinned development SDK. The current host and npm declarations need no change, so no PR will be opened. The evidence-only audit branch retains the tracker item for orchestrator verification."
